  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Fixed duplicated Tags issue #155 2026-03-13\n- fix: recognize net10+ target frameworks for modern C# feature emission 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --base-url CLI option with validation, tests, and docs 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --security-scheme CLI option for specs missing auth (#140) 2026-03-10\n- feat: add Claude Code skill for AI-assisted SDK generation 2026-03-10\n- feat: migrate initialize command from .sln to .slnx format 2026-03-09\n- feat: use default/const values from OpenAPI parameters as C# default parameter values 2026-03-05\n- feat: improve oneOf/anyOf ergonomics with semantic variant naming (#133) 2026-03-05\n- feat: More broad support for .http files 2026-03-04\n- feat: Added support for ServerSentEvents. 2026-03-04\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- Codex/fix auto merge personal token (#153) 2026-03-13\n- fix: use personal token for auto-merge workflow (#152) 2026-03-13\n- fix: recognize net10+ target frameworks for modern C# feature emission 2026-03-11\n- fix: resolve IsBinary for nullable anyOf binary schemas (#149) 2026-03-11\n- fix: handle additionalProperties naming collision with JsonExtensionData (#148) 2026-03-11\n- fix: register injected security schemes with document workspace (#146) 2026-03-11\n- fix: handle special characters in schema titles for valid C# identifiers 2026-03-11\n- fix: extend numeric constraint sanitization with ExclusiveMin/Max and tests 2026-03-11\n- fix: sanitize extreme integer minimum/maximum values during spec processing 2026-03-11\n- fix: resolve codegen issues with AnyOf types containing enum values 2026-03-10",
